entColor\" stroke=\"none\">y</text><polyline points=\"46,132.9 49,127.8 52,122.9 55.1,118.4 58.1,114 61.1,109.9 64.1,106.1 67.2,102.4 70.2,99 73.2,95.7 76.2,92.6 79.2,89.7 82.3,86.9 85.3,84.3 88.3,81.8 91.3,79.4 94.4,77.2 97.4,75.1 100.4,73.1 103.4,71.3 106.4,69.5 109.5,67.8 112.5,66.2 115.5,64.7 118.5,63.3 121.6,61.9 124.6,60.7 127.6,59.5 130.6,58.3 133.6,57.2 136.7,56.2 139.7,55.3 142.7,54.3 145.7,53.5 148.8,52.7 151.8,51.9 154.8,51.2 157.8,50.5 160.8,49.8 163.9,49.2 166.9,48.6 169.9,48.1 172.9,47.5 176,47 179,46.6 182,46.1 185,45.7 188,45.3 191.1,44.9 194.1,44.6 197.1,44.3 200.1,43.9 203.2,43.6 206.2,43.4 209.2,43.1 212.2,42.8 215.2,42.6 218.3,42.4 221.3,42.1 224.3,41.9 227.3,41.7 230.4,41.6 233.4,41.4 236.4,41.2 239.4,41.1 242.4,40.9 245.5,40.8 248.5,40.7 251.5,40.5 254.5,40.4 257.6,40.3 260.6,40.2 263.6,40.1 266.6,40 269.6,39.9 272.7,39.8 275.7,39.8 278.7,39.7 281.7,39.6 284.8,39.6 287.8,39.5 290.8,39.4 293.8,39.4 296.8,39.3 299.9,39.3 302.9,39.2 305.9,39.2 308.9,39.1 312,39.1 315,39.1 318,39\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></svg>","figure_alt":"A smooth curve that rises toward a horizontal line."},{"id":"first-order-sys-r4-q3","version":1,"round":4,"type":"mc","prompt":"A proportional controller wraps a stable first-order plant. The reference steps and then holds. The error settles at","options":["zero, because the loop is stable","zero, because a first-order plant already contains an integrator","a ramp that grows without bound","a nonzero constant"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Proportional control produces a command \\(u = K_c(r - y)\\). A first-order plant has a finite DC gain and no free integrator, so a constant error is required to hold a constant output. Stability says the error settles, not that it settles at zero. The plant equation \\(\\tau\\dot{y} + y = Ku\\) reaches a constant, so the error is not a ramp. An integrator would be \\(\\dot{y} = Ku\\), which this plant is not.","preview":["pid"],"figure":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 234 140\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\"><title>proportional loop</title><text x=\"24\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">r</text><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"56\"/><polygon points=\"78,56 71.6,58.7 71.6,53.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><rect x=\"78\" y=\"34\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plant</text><line x1=\"162\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"56\"/><polygon points=\"198,56 191.6,58.7 191.6,53.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">y</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"100\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"100\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"72\"/><polygon points=\"40,72 42.7,78.4 37.3,78.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"119\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">1</text></svg>","figure_alt":"A plant block with a return path to the input."}]}